LINE|n=1|text=THE FOUR FROZEN SLICE AGENTS — Laws 23-26, one measured demo each
LINE|n=2|text=
LINE|n=3|text===========================================================================
LINE|n=4|text=AGENT 1 — FISCHER (Law 23): -,0,+ at every level
LINE|n=5|text=  sphere (Z/1000081Z)*  g=7  point=g^77777
LINE|n=6|text=  level 3    : third #2
LINE|n=7|text=  level 27   : k mod 27 = 17  trime digits [-0-]  (cascaded, -,0,+)
LINE|n=8|text=  level rime : full k = 77777  byte-exact invert = True
LINE|n=9|text=  GATE: cost is sqrt-scaled per prime tower; one large tower is the wall (Law 14).
LINE|n=10|text===========================================================================
LINE|n=11|text=AGENT 2 — MTP (Law 24): frozen multi-token prediction  x1 / x3 / x27
LINE|n=12|text=  direction 0 (hold)     : accuracy 1.0000  — the free center, costs nothing, says nothing
LINE|n=13|text=  direction + (forward)  : x1 0.0458   x3 0.0000   x27 0.0000
LINE|n=14|text=  direction - (backward) : x1 0.0475   (frozen on reversed time — real, ~symmetric)
LINE|n=15|text=  GATE: lookahead accuracy DECAYS with depth — compounding error, DPI. A frozen
LINE|n=16|text=  model predicts a fraction, never recreates unseen wholes (Laws 18/22).
LINE|n=17|text===========================================================================
LINE|n=18|text=AGENT 3 — HRM (Law 25): two-rate hierarchy, slow picks the level, fast predicts
LINE|n=19|text=  levels used: deep(27-ish ctx) 99%  mid(3-ish) 0%  base(rime floor) 0%
LINE|n=20|text=  frozen hierarchical bpc on held-out enwik8 = 4.4871
LINE|n=21|text=  GATE: the hierarchy ROUTES between frozen levels (+,0,-); it never dips below
LINE|n=22|text=  the entropy of what the levels jointly know (Law 15/21).
LINE|n=23|text===========================================================================
LINE|n=24|text=AGENT 4 — MCP (Law 26): stateless cells x CRT fan-in  (3 x 27-structured x rime)
LINE|n=25|text=  cells: sphere(Z/163Z)* + sphere(Z/271Z)* + sphere(Z/379Z)*  (each 27|q-1)
LINE|n=26|text=  address space M = 4,814,857   batch of 9 values round-tripped: byte-exact = True
LINE|n=27|text=  GATE: cells are STATELESS (the SGRAM doctrine) — all knowledge is in the frozen
LINE|n=28|text=  spheres; the coordinator only fans in. Addressing axis, ~0 bpc, never compression.
